("'All A are B. All B are C. Therefore, all A are C.' This form is:", ["Always valid", "Always invalid", "Sometimes valid", "A contradiction"], "Always valid", "This is the transitive chain (Barbara syllogism). If A ⊂ B and B ⊂ C, then A ⊂ C — always.", ["valid arguments", "hypothetical syllogism"]),
